{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille and Laura is a short narrative game about the daily life of a single mother.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/b4be8ad95532b2364071e35636585a96.poster.avif?t=1757608370\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/b4be8ad95532b2364071e35636585a96.webm?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/b4be8ad95532b2364071e35636585a96.mp4?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille is five years old and it is her first week of elementary school in Quebec - one of the most important week in someone\u2019s life! Take on the role of Laura, her mother, as she tries her best. Navigate office relationships, conduct daily chores, and raise your \u2018little seal\u2019 as best you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille and Laura blends the childhood drawings of character Camille with the thoughts and choices of her mother, Laura, shining a light on their daily routine as they encounter their first week of school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported by the Canada Council for the Arts, Camille and Laura is a short narrative game with an honest look at the realities of life and daily struggles.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/6d5bae9431f9064be55585e29cb22712.poster.avif?t=1757608370\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/6d5bae9431f9064be55585e29cb22712.webm?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/6d5bae9431f9064be55585e29cb22712.mp4?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art, styled as children\u2019s drawings taped to the fridge </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative adventure with branching dialogue choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click interactions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily chores, work, and ruminations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relevant, animal-based bedtime stories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some good gags, even more bad ones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An honest look at the reality of human existence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least one fun giraffe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I developed Camille and Laura solo with the help of the Canada Council for the Arts. Your support means the world to me.</i>\u00a0<i>- Olivier</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/08759f35e2bd612121a3d8351a80a26c.poster.avif?t=1757608370\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/08759f35e2bd612121a3d8351a80a26c.webm?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/08759f35e2bd612121a3d8351a80a26c.mp4?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Monday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/535503241dc56c5ed9a52aa223dcd230c58a3077.jpg"},{"name":"Tuesday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/fd9fea40b73dbbe5f703213de33c6b9c1a635f7b.jpg"},{"name":"Wednesday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/b4a729a196abfb9d520a8a7eabb96258a816b576.jpg"},{"name":"Thursday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/716171b68c0568206e0ca2fc6139add4812a61a9.jpg"},{"name":"Friday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/77436238faaa08059c1572bf91bd1cd7530380aa.jpg"},{"name":"Coffee's good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/d8e63bbb38bd10b6a7f0bc24e67bd0f441780a2a.jpg"},{"name":"Hug Jameela","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/0e751e32557f0aae75fc16a8580d22f4c9dd6508.jpg"},{"name":"That's a weird name for a book","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/7a100ea6af0cbbf6857c671904d2725f5675eb72.jpg"},{"name":"Be a good worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/c4256a38cd9fc46791967706a147df3c531f7d5a.jpg"},{"name":"Frugal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129110/9d9e2c373fa0665429eaa62f825d3e36c660b53a.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129110?t=1757608370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757608370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/76f21c7f741ef806329b50fa28768dfe8e49873f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757608370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/76f21c7f741ef806329b50fa28768dfe8e49873f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757608370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some swearing and cursing in the dialogues. Uses of alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille and Laura is a short narrative game about the daily life of a single mother.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/b4be8ad95532b2364071e35636585a96.poster.avif?t=1757608370\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/b4be8ad95532b2364071e35636585a96.webm?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/b4be8ad95532b2364071e35636585a96.mp4?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille is five years old and it is her first week of elementary school in Quebec - one of the most important week in someone\u2019s life! Take on the role of Laura, her mother, as she tries her best. Navigate office relationships, conduct daily chores, and raise your \u2018little seal\u2019 as best you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille and Laura blends the childhood drawings of character Camille with the thoughts and choices of her mother, Laura, shining a light on their daily routine as they encounter their first week of school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported by the Canada Council for the Arts, Camille and Laura is a short narrative game with an honest look at the realities of life and daily struggles.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/6d5bae9431f9064be55585e29cb22712.poster.avif?t=1757608370\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/6d5bae9431f9064be55585e29cb22712.webm?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/6d5bae9431f9064be55585e29cb22712.mp4?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art, styled as children\u2019s drawings taped to the fridge </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative adventure with branching dialogue choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click interactions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily chores, work, and ruminations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relevant, animal-based bedtime stories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some good gags, even more bad ones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An honest look at the reality of human existence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least one fun giraffe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I developed Camille and Laura solo with the help of the Canada Council for the Arts. Your support means the world to me.</i>\u00a0<i>- Olivier</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/08759f35e2bd612121a3d8351a80a26c.poster.avif?t=1757608370\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/08759f35e2bd612121a3d8351a80a26c.webm?t=1757608370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129110/extras/08759f35e2bd612121a3d8351a80a26c.mp4?t=